{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1776.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"1ac542e34b10d4230815fab801917117146276f7a312ac079aa9e0311fe137f2","ja":"贈り物を贈ってくれた人","zh":"赠送礼物的人","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1776.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"1f510e6f78022e520db34d3e3234da49e94f216dc7727c100ee81f20be64d74f","ja":"（スカジのお店に、高級なカフェ。\nもしかして、まつりちゃんは……）","zh":"（在スカジ的店里，有一家高级咖啡馆。难道说，茉莉她……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1776.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"7caafdb70de1b19db39efc255a4e424119c2fc711274d496797a9c1c9d02e563","ja":"今日は誘ってくれてありがとう。バッグに合うお店を\n考えて、私を連れ出してくれたのよね？","zh":"谢谢你今天邀请我。你是考虑到要找一家适合这款包的店，才带我出来的吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1776.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"525aafe3c012545ab429d39fbf0fdc5e0c22a99c29cf1ee6cab96ca29bf9250b","ja":"ほ？　姫は、歌織ちゃんと行きたい場所を、\nお散歩しているだけなのですよ？","zh":"什么？姬只是和歌织一起在想去的地方散步而已哦？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1776.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"ea838b8bf257f13fef49df641f17c14757216c146ded2162046a3d22729032dd","ja":"あら、そうなの？　バッグに慣れるように、\n考えてくれてたのかと思ったのだけど。","zh":"咦，是这样吗？我还以为你是在想办法让我适应这个包呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1776.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"5cfffe138c1dbe3d69d3f65ac75a9e9d367d00257c639b90721ac2d21ac6b380","ja":"……姫は知っているのですよ。\n贈り物を、大切に使っていると……。","zh":"……公主可是知道的哦。\n知道你一直很珍惜地使用着那份礼物……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1776.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"722e8ee6d703df0c64736d3a06490ef75456905f58b7dc424f10d01d11103f20","ja":"贈ってくれた人が、とっても喜ぶのです。\nだからこれからも、バッグを大切に使うといいのです。","zh":"送礼物给你的人会非常高兴的。\n所以今后也要好好珍惜并使用这个包哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1776.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"25606e2446925af0fe9fe06bc562782269d23238a09df06d8a3472fbaf7e0e4a","ja":"そういえば今朝、私がバッグを持ってるのを見て、\n父が喜んでいたように見えたわね……。","zh":"说起来，今天早上父亲看到我拿着包时，好像挺高兴的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1776.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"44052cb8a7790180c422dc22b71a6f5d226969629df87c5935eb063188166840","ja":"ふふ、そういうことか……すごいなあ。\nまつりちゃんって、私よりずっと大人だね♪","zh":"呵呵，原来是这么回事……真厉害啊。  \n小祭比我成熟多了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1776.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"5f3c75b4ca9cc333eede3b430c6c83a6ace055fc4e0e9dd474fbe3549db3480e","ja":"まつりは姫なので、お城にたくさん贈り物が\n届くのです。だから、知っていただけなのですよ。","zh":"因为小公主是公主，所以城堡里会收到很多礼物。只是因为知道这一点而已哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1776.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"51a7a5f0ac35bf95774e52c280bc025417ec65a2a2511f1de4a9cb723f8fc4fd","ja":"そうなのね……ありがとう。\nおかげで緊張も、どこかにいっちゃった。","zh":"原来是这样……谢谢。\n多亏了你，我也不紧张了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1776.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"841f0899917a1d922db10f1b929cb177f588f7511560e4de2a0779a0288d0130","ja":"この後も、一緒にお出かけしてくれる？","zh":"之后也愿意和我一起出去吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1776.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"d0644303f25254820274c984d5c79ec03d7da5112a2852ce48cd610a39760292","ja":"もちろんなのです！　お姫様のお花畑、\n夜の光がキラキラ輝くレストラン……。","zh":"当然啦！公主的花田，还有夜色中闪闪发光的餐厅……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1776.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"f94b21ed248c7953ee1d82eed4a441a92b58909bb1139586a4a3a7cab327939f","ja":"歌織ちゃんと行きたいところが、\nまだまだたくさんあるのですよ！","zh":"还有好多想和歌织一起去的地方呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1776.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"2d98588c403c8bcddbddb86db81781b79e6df4533ec7b57daab17097d5a4ad1f","ja":"それじゃあ、もっともっと楽しみましょ。\nこのバッグと一緒に♪","zh":"那么，就一起享受更多更多的乐趣吧。\n和这个包包一起♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
